{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22991","headline":"题遗爱寺前溪松 · 白居易","name":"题遗爱寺前溪松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偃亚长松树，侵临小石溪。\n静将流水对，高共远峰齐。\n翠盖烟笼密，花幢雪压低。\n与僧清影坐，借鹤稳枝栖。\n笔写形难似，琴偷韵易迷。\n暑天风槭槭，晴夜露凄凄。\n独契依爲舍，闲行遶作蹊。\n栋梁君莫采，留着伴幽栖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22991.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22991","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}